OL,3,GNEWSABusinesses asked to share digital
OL,4,Abanking barriers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe organisation said some online
OL,7,Fbanking and payments providers
OL,8,Favailable to UK companies were
OL,9,Funavailable to island businesses,
OL,10,Fputting them at a competitive
OL,11,Fdisadvantage.
OL,13,FChair of Innovate Guernsey Susan Watson
OL,14,Fsaid the aim was to "show the combined
OL,15,Fsize of the market these providers are
OL,16,Fmissing".
